sec.p:
Since the early work on S-LDSC, conservation scores have been found to be the most enriched annotation for complex trait heritability48. More recently, primate-specific conservation—particularly PhastCons (P)—has emerged as the state-of-the-art for complex trait heritability enrichment7,8. Notably, GPN-Star (P) substantially improves on this result, followed by GPN-Star (M) (Fig. 3a). These improvements are even more striking when examining the heritability coefficient \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
